    "en": "Standard budget execution reports (worldwide PFM)",
    "hi": "मानक बजट निष्पादन रिपोर्ट (अंतरराष्ट्रीय सार्वजनिक वित्त)"
  },
  "domain": "Public finance (international)",
  "description": "In-year and annual budget execution reports (PFM-040, PEFA PI-1, PI-2, PI-28): the ledger extract by every segment and stage (original, revised, released, committed, verified, paid, available) is taken from the ledger, the preparer explains the variances, a different officer approves, and the report is issued by the due date from DMN. The due dates are SYNTHETIC until the country confirms them.",
